, so \\( f(48) = 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 6 + 8 + 12 + 16 + 24 + 48 = 124 \\).\n    - Since 124 is not a prime number, 47 is not a bouncy prime.\n\n16. For \\( n = 53 \\):\n    - The divisors of 53 are 1 and 53"},"grade":{"answer":"[53]","correct":false,"format":"other","parseable":true},"id":"number_theory:492"}
